==Trivia==
* The {{wp|minotaur}} is a legendary creature from Greek mythology that had the head of a bull and the body of a man, which dwelled within the Labyrinth of the Cretan King Minos. It was slain by the Greek hero Theseus in order to halt Athenian sacrifices of children as a war indemnity to Crete.

